) Tops Q3 EPS by 60c, Beats on Revenue; Offers FY26 EPS Guidance","src":"StreetInsider","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"Biogen (BIIB) 第三季每股盈餘成長 60c，營收超過預期；提供 2026 財年每股盈餘指引"},{"title":"[Biogen Q3 2026 Earnings Call] Biogen Revenue Climbs 11% to $2.8B as Apellis Integration Accelerates, Full-Year EPS Guidance Tightened to $12.20–$13.00","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1IYThVRlMxZFU4WXRLeU5kbnQ2aFFqQS1ZLUVURzlVeDVPLUhCVUx0U3NLMXB1WjExazFDSHlEbjZMOGZGLWo5MERlSlNlWkU5WUM2YS1tX21oTWhGeUE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"[百健 (Biogen) 2026 年第三季財報電話會議] 隨著 Apellis 整合加速，百健 (Biogen) 營收攀升 11% 至 $2.8B，全年 EPS 指引收緊至 $12.20–$13.00"},{"title":"Biogen Q3 Earnings Beat Estimates as Revenue Rises 11% and 2026 Profit Guidance Improves","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOVU5yQUswaW1Hb0hYQVVWQThSN1lkRVUwMk12RzZNWFBDdTRyN2psUWZlSkp1Y3Vpa2lkSXJmUng5ejlUaXd6dXlabExLTjZEV2ZQNXlNdmVwc2JVNTNJN2Z6S0doN3JHLWlEVjNjVmc1OWQtS0pqRUVYT1R4QzRnZUVSNjhDX2U1UGNHbjA5T1M2bXdRNU1lbEtn?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"百健 (Biogen) 第三季財報超出預期，營收成長 11%，2026 年獲利指引有所改善"},{"title":"Should Earnings Beat Require Action From Biogen Stock Investors?","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"獲利超出預期是否需要百健（Biogen）股票投資者採取行動？"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"分析師評等","count":7}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-06","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/875045/000087504526000013/biib-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Biogen is a global biopharmaceutical company focused on discovering, developing and delivering innovative therapies for people living with serious and complex diseases. We have a broad portfolio of medicines to treat MS, have introduced the first approved treatment for SMA, co-developed treatments to address a defining pathology of Alzheimer's disease and launched the first approved treatment to target a genetic cause of ALS. We market the first and only drug approved in the U.S., the E.U. and certain international markets for the treatment of FA in adults and adolescents aged 16 years and older. We are focused on advancing our pipeline in neurology, specialized immunology and rare diseases. We support our drug discovery and development efforts through internal research and development programs, external collaborations and acquisitions.","zh":"Biogen 是一家全球生物製藥公司，致力於為患有嚴重和複雜疾病的人們發現、開發和提供創新療法。我們擁有廣泛的治療多發性硬化症的藥物組合，推出了第一個經批准的 SMA 治療方法，共同開發了針對阿茲海默症定義病理學的治療方法，並推出了第一個經批准的針對 ALS 遺傳原因的治療方法。我們銷售第一種也是唯一在美國和歐盟獲得批准的藥物。以及治療成人和 16 歲及以上青少年 FA 的某些國際市場。我們專注於推進神經病學、專業免疫學和罕見疾病領域的研發管線。我們透過內部研發計劃、外部合作和收購來支持我們的藥物發現和開發工作。"},{"en":"Our marketed products include VUMERITY, TYSABRI, TECFIDERA, AVONEX and PLEGRIDY for the treatment of MS; SPINRAZA for the treatment of SMA; SKYCLARYS for the treatment of FA; and QALSODY for the treatment of ALS.","zh":"我們銷售的治療多發性硬化症的產品包括VUMERITY、TYSABRI、TECFIDERA、AVONEX和PLEGRIDY； SPINRAZA 用於治療 SMA； SKYCLARYS 用於治療 FA；和 QALSODY 用於治療 ALS。"},{"en":"We also have collaborations with Eisai on the commercialization of LEQEMBI for the treatment of Alzheimer's disease and Supernus on the commercialization of ZURZUVAE for the treatment of PPD. We have certain business and financial rights with respect to RITUXAN for the treatment of non-Hodgkin's lymphoma, CLL and other conditions; RITUXAN HYCELA for the treatment of non-Hodgkin's lymphoma and CLL; GAZYVA for the treatment of CLL, follicular lymphoma and, following its approval in October 2025, lupus nephritis; OCREVUS for the treatment of PPMS and RMS; LUNSUMIO for the treatment of relapsed or refractory follicular lymphoma; COLUMVI, a bispecific antibody for the treatment of non-Hodgkin's lymphoma; and have the option to add other potential anti-CD20 therapies, pursuant to our collaboration arrangements with Genentech, a wholly owned member of the Roche Group.","zh":"我們也與衛材合作，將 LEQEMBI 商業化，用於治療阿茲海默症；與 Supernus 合作，將 ZURZUVAE 商業化，用於治療 PPD。我們對 RITUXAN 用於治療非何杰金氏淋巴瘤、CLL 和其他疾病擁有一定的業務和財務權利； RITUXAN HYCELA 用於治療非霍奇金淋巴瘤和 CLL； GAZYVA 用於治療 CLL、濾泡性淋巴瘤，並於 2025 年 10 月獲得批准後用於治療狼瘡性腎炎； COLUMVI，一種用於治療非何杰金氏淋巴瘤的雙特異性抗體；根據我們與羅氏集團全資子公司基因泰克的合作安排，我們可以選擇添加其他潛在的抗 CD20 療法。"}],"markets":[{"en":"In December 2025 we and Eisai announced that LEQEMBI has been included in the \"Commercial Insurance Innovative Drug List\" recently introduced by the National Healthcare Security Administration of China. The Commercial Insurance Innovative Drug List is based on new policies of the Chinese government to support the development and access of innovative medicines.","zh":"2025年12月，我們和衛材宣布LEQEMBI已被納入中國國家醫療保障局最近推出的「商業保險創新藥目錄」。商業保險創新藥目錄是根據中國政府支持創新藥研發和取得的新政策而製定的。"},{"en":"In December 2025 Eisai presented Phase 3 clinical data confirming pharmacological effect of LEQEMBI at the 2025 CTAD conference. The findings represent the results from a large-scale clinical study demonstrating, for the first time, that binding of lecanemab to protofibrils can be measured in cerebrospinal fluid, enabling further understanding of how lecanemab slows Alzheimer's disease progression.","zh":"2025 年 12 月，衛材在 2025 年 CTAD 會議上展示了證實 LEQEMBI 藥理作用的 3 期臨床數據。這些發現代表了一項大規模臨床研究的結果，首次證明可以在腦脊髓液中測量lecanemab與原纖維的結合，從而進一步了解lecanemab如何減緩阿茲海默症的進展。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"MS Product Revenues","val":4038900000,"zh":"MS 產品收入"},{"name":"Rare Disease Product Revenue","val":2154200000,"zh":"罕見疾病產品收入"},{"name":"Revenues From Anti CD20Therapeutic Programs","val":1860600000,"zh":"抗 CD20 治療項目的收入"},{"name":"Tysabri Product","val":1665400000,"zh":"泰薩布里產品"},{"name":"SPINRAZA","val":1546800000,"zh":"斯賓拉扎"},{"name":"Fumarate","val":1426500000,"zh":"富馬酸鹽"},{"name":"Royalty Attributed To OCREVUS","val":1414900000,"zh":"歸屬於 OCREVUS 的版稅"},{"name":"Interferon","val":945600000,"zh":"幹擾素"},{"name":"VUMERITY","val":746800000,"zh":"數量"},{"name":"Contract Manufacturing Royalty & Other Revenue","val":732900000,"zh":"合約製造特許權使用費和其他收入"}],"total":9890600000}},"peers":["REGN","AMGN","GILD","VRTX","ILMN"]}}